# HDN Central

Django web app that dispatches catalog SPARQL queries to the registered
HDN endpoints (`tdn-endpoint`) and merges the answers.

## Installation

Requires Python 3.10+.

```bash
git clone https://github.com/mircocazzaro/central-tdn.git
cd central-tdn
python3 -m venv .venv
. .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py createsuperuser      # account used to log in to the catalog
python manage.py runserver 0.0.0.0:8000
```

Open `http://<host>:8000/` and log in with the account you just created.

## Registering endpoints

Go to **Endpoints** in the navbar (manager password: `ENDPOINT_MANAGER_PASSWORD`
in `centralproject/settings.py`) and add each node with its base URL,
e.g. `http://tdn.example.org/api0`. Central posts queries to
`<base URL>/sparql-protected/`. The logo is optional.

## Layout

```
centralproject/   settings, root URLs
catalogapp/
  queries.py      query catalog (must match the endpoints' catalog)
  forms.py        parameter forms and allowed values
  views.py        catalog, dispatch, analytics, endpoint manager
  templates/      UI
```
